What to do as a contributor:
PLEASE, fork the repo to make your edits and submit PRs so we can have a clean system!
Issue reports are in the default GitHub issue tracker, an example is already there along with a pull request example

The PRs are so we can easily group commits as one giant thing.
Issues on GitHub are for the same reason.

Also, please help out with converting this to actual FTC readable code rather then a sketch.

Pull Request Example:
Hello, i forked the repository on my main GitHub account
Just adding these 3 lines...